        "verified": true
      },
      "created_at": "2026-11-22T12:50:10.000Z",
      "text": "On my way to seek the blessings of Baba Mahakal in the sacred city of Ujjain, I got the opportunity to take a short break at a Retail Outlet of BPCL being run by M/s Shivlal Patel & Sons on the State Highway 27 between Indore and Ujjain.\n\nThe outlet offers a range of products and services for highway travellers. It was a pleasure interacting with the dedicated Energy Soldiers and reviewing the DriveFresh facilities, DDD Bowser and non-fuel offerings at the adjoining Charpai Dhaba and Pyali Café.\n\nWe also discussed the importance of maintaining high standards of cleanliness and hygiene, ensuring convenient facilities for customers and encouraging greater customer feedback to help us continuously improve our services.\n\n@PMOIndia @PetroleumMin \n@DrMohanYadav51 \n@Secretary_MoPNG @BPCLimited \n@BPCLRetail1 @BPCLMakLubes @BPCLLPG @BPCLIndore @cmdbpcl @DirectorM_BPCL @BPCL_Gas_BU @SwachhBharatGov #BeFreshDriveFresh\n#DriveFresh\n#EnergyStations",
