      "created_at": "2026-11-22T09:56:05.000Z",
      "text": "From E20 to E13, and now people are once again reporting issues especially in cars like these. The reality is that most premium car owners don’t make much noise about it, so it rarely gets mainstream media attention.\n\nI experienced something similar with a G-Wagon in Leh-Ladakh myself.\n\nIt genuinely feels like India is becoming less friendly for automotive enthusiasts. \n\nVehicles are increasingly treated as disposable products buy, use, replace, and repeat. \n\nIn the end, it seems to benefit corporations through more sales and governments through higher tax collections, while long-term ownership and enthusiast interests take a back seat.",
